{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10008","headline":"郑国夫人挽歌词 · 赵良器","name":"郑国夫人挽歌词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淑德延公胄，宜家接帝姻。\n桂宫男掌仆，兰殿女昇嫔。\n恩泽昭前命，盈虚变此辰。\n万年今已矣，彤管列何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵良器","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}